    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CashFlow AI - Daily Collections Autopilot\nEvery morning: pulls open invoices ranked by **cash at risk** from the ML prediction API, drafts a tone-appropriate reminder for each with AI, and routes high-value HIGH-risk accounts to a manager for approval before anything is sent.\n\n**Demo mode:** `as_of` in *Run Settings* simulates \"today\" inside the 2013 dataset.\n\nAPI + model code: github.com/alameen1977/cashflow-ai",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "35ebde61-7e67-4476-bec1-cc6ea74c62cb",
      "name": "Sticky Note c8c807de",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Control step\nHIGH-risk invoices above the 90th-percentile amount are **held for manager approval** - the automation never sends a firm message to a key account without a human sign-off. Everything else is marked READY_TO_SEND.",
        "height": 432,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 3
